#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:51 5858d4b3c4424048a6bd8ea1be00d7fc
msgid "Example: Dobot to ARX"
msgstr "示例：从 Dobot 切换到 ARX"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:53 613493e5782d481a9bbbdc933a923443
msgid ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Acone (arm only, not Lift 2s)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Acone (arm only, not Lift 2s)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:70 c1b9ee2cb26e4fdea546815f52a1e359
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is the manipulator. Full-body **Ark / Lift 2s** (`arx_lift2s`) "
"uses `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` on the `arx-lift2s` "
"branch — see [Ark / Lift 2s](11-ark_lift2s.md). Panthera HT launch name is "
"`panthera_ht` — see [Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是操作臂。全身 **Ark / Lift 2s**（`arx_lift2s`）在 `arx-lift2s` 分支上使用 "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` — 见 [Ark / Lift "
"2s](11-ark_lift2s.md)。Panthera HT 的 launch 名是 `panthera_ht` — 见 [Panthera "
"HT](12-panthera_ht.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:72 699e1f4d38eb4a2fa5260cb149cca1de
msgid "With Grippers"
msgstr "搭配夹爪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:74 239f4684025a46b7afa685508234f6f1
msgid ""
"Different robots support different grippers. The `gripper:=` parameter "
"specifies the end-effector."
msgstr "不同机器人支持不同的夹爪。`gripper:=` 参数用于指定末端执行器。"

